6th Annual Fragrant Breeze Golf Tournament
BURFORD GOLF LINKS COURSE
OCTOBER 5TH 2026

PROXIMITY HOLES & CONTEST RULES

NOTE FOR LADIES CTP, IF THE TAG IS NOT YET ON GREEN, WRITE YOUR NAME EVEN IF YOUR BALL IS IN THE ROUGH

OFFICIAL CONTEST HOLES:
Hole #2  - Closest to pin (LADIES)
Hole #5  - Closest to pin (both MEN & LADIES) - 2 TAGS
Hole #7  - Closest to pin (MEN)
Hole #10 - Closest to squiggly rope (both MEN & LADIES) - 2 TAGS
Hole #11 - Closest to pin (LADIES)
Hole #11 - HOLE IN ONE CHALLENGE (ALL) $111.11 sponsored by Bari M.
Hole #13 - Closest to pin (MEN)
Hole #16 - Longest drive in fairway (MEN)
Hole #17 - Longest drive in fairway (LADIES)
Hole #18 - Longest PUTT (ALL)

QUERKY HOLES:
Hole #3  - Team surprise awaits --- RACK 'EM UP. 
           Each partner must hole out.
           (Tee to green strokes + sum of all putts from each partner to hole)

Hole #9  - Worst Ball Putting 
           (both players putt from the ball furthest from pin)

Hole #15 - Do or Die
           Each player allowed an optional mulligan anywhere on this hole.
           But once you hit a mulligan, the 1st shot no longer is in play.
           Keep track of mulligans (tie-breaker)
